mutation add an archived day twice on a later refresh
detects ArchiveOnce
only ThreeDays
-                /\ pendingArchive' = archived + (nowDay - archivedThrough - 1)
+                /\ pendingArchive' = archived + nowDay

mutation persist a failed query as if it had produced a new day
detects FailedFetchKeepsArchive
only Failure
-                /\ archived' = archived
+                /\ archived' = archived + 1

mutation archive the current incomplete day
detects NoFutureArchive
only ThreeDays
-                /\ pendingThrough' = nowDay - 1
+                /\ pendingThrough' = nowDay

mutation enter an impossible refresh phase
detects TypeOK
only ThreeDays
-                /\ phase' = "fetch"
+                /\ phase' = "corrupt"
